// 한글·영문·숫자 안전한 폭 측정 기반 줄바꿈 유틸리티
function wrapCanvasLines(ctx, text, maxWidth) {
  if (!text) return [""];
  const paragraphs = String(text).split(/\r?\n/);
  const result = [];

  for (const para of paragraphs) {
    if (para.trim() === "") {
      result.push("");
      continue;
    }
    let currentLine = "";
    for (let i = 0; i < para.length; i++) {
      const ch = para[i];
      const testLine = currentLine + ch;
      if (ctx.measureText(testLine).width > maxWidth && currentLine.length > 0) {
        result.push(currentLine);
        currentLine = ch === " " ? "" : ch;
      } else {
        currentLine = testLine;
      }
    }
    if (currentLine.length > 0) {
      result.push(currentLine);
    }
  }
  return result.length > 0 ? result : [""];
}

function drawRoundedRect(ctx, x, y, w, h, r, fillStyle, strokeStyle, lineWidth = 1.5) {
  ctx.save();
  ctx.beginPath();
  ctx.moveTo(x + r, y);
  ctx.arcTo(x + w, y, x + w, y + h, r);
  ctx.arcTo(x + w, y + h, x, y + h, r);
  ctx.arcTo(x, y + h, x, y, r);
  ctx.arcTo(x, y, x + w, y, r);
  ctx.closePath();
  if (fillStyle) {
    ctx.fillStyle = fillStyle;
    ctx.fill();
  }
  if (strokeStyle) {
    ctx.lineWidth = lineWidth;
    ctx.strokeStyle = strokeStyle;
    ctx.stroke();
  }
  ctx.restore();
}

// 다중 A4 페이지 캔버스 매니저 (블록 단위 넘김 및 페이지 번호 푸터 자동 삽입)
function createPaginatedCanvasManager() {
  const PAGE_W = 1240;
  const PAGE_H = 1754; // A4 비율 (1 : 1.4145)
  const MARGIN_X = 64;
  const MARGIN_TOP = 64;
  const MARGIN_BOTTOM = 76;
  const CONTENT_W = PAGE_W - MARGIN_X * 2;
  const FONT_FAMILY = '-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Pretendard", "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Malgun Gothic", sans-serif';

  const pages = [];
  let ctx = null;
  let y = MARGIN_TOP;

  function addNewPage(isFirst = false) {
    const canvas = document.createElement("canvas");
    canvas.width = PAGE_W;
    canvas.height = PAGE_H;
    ctx = canvas.getContext("2d");
    ctx.fillStyle = "#ffffff";
    ctx.fillRect(0, 0, PAGE_W, PAGE_H);
    pages.push(canvas);
    y = MARGIN_TOP;

    if (!isFirst) {
      ctx.font = `700 18px ${FONT_FAMILY}`;
      ctx.fillStyle = "#64748b";
      ctx.fillText("사주&컬러코드", MARGIN_X, y);
      y += 14;
      ctx.strokeStyle = "#e2e8f0";
      ctx.lineWidth = 1.5;
      ctx.beginPath();
      ctx.moveTo(MARGIN_X, y);
      ctx.lineTo(PAGE_W - MARGIN_X, y);
      ctx.stroke();
      y += 28;
    }
  }

  function ensureSpace(neededHeight) {
    if (y + neededHeight > PAGE_H - MARGIN_BOTTOM) {
      addNewPage(false);
    }
  }

  function forcePageBreak() {
    if (y > MARGIN_TOP + 40) {
      addNewPage(false);
    }
  }

  function finalizeFooters() {
    const total = pages.length;
    pages.forEach((canvas, idx) => {
      const pCtx = canvas.getContext("2d");
      pCtx.save();
      pCtx.font = `600 17px ${FONT_FAMILY}`;
      pCtx.fillStyle = "#94a3b8";
      pCtx.textAlign = "right";
      pCtx.fillText(`${idx + 1} / ${total}`, PAGE_W - MARGIN_X, PAGE_H - 26);
      pCtx.restore();
    });
  }

  addNewPage(true);

  return {
    PAGE_W, PAGE_H, MARGIN_X, CONTENT_W, FONT_FAMILY,
    getCtx: () => ctx,
    getY: () => y,
    setY: (val) => { y = val; },
    addY: (delta) => { y += delta; },
    ensureSpace,
    forcePageBreak,
    finalizeFooters,
    getPages: () => pages
  };
}

// 개인 사주 리포트 A4 다중 페이지 캔버스 렌더링
